{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>擁有130萬粉絲追蹤的27歲泰國網紅Natpaphat Ounboontan近日低調來到香港街頭朝聖打卡。她以 …</p><p></p>\n<p>擁有130萬粉絲追蹤的27歲泰國網紅Natpaphat Ounboontan近日低調來到香港街頭朝聖打卡。她以一身極度清涼純白小背心現身鬧市，衣著暗藏極具衝擊力震撼細節，非常蠱惑！</p>\n<h2>泰國女神街頭打卡 狂吸2萬like</h2>\n<p>Natpaphat Ounboontan走到香港街頭拍下一系列充滿質感照片，畫面中她穿上一件緊身白色小背心，完美勾勒出火辣身材曲線。這件上衣兩側採用大膽通窿剪裁設計，隨著她擺出不同甫士，輕易展露出傲人南半球線條，營造出極大視覺衝擊力。帖文一出隨即吸引大量2.4萬人點讚！</p>\n<h2>27歲網紅擅長大膽風格出鏡</h2>\n<p>1999年出生Natpaphat Ounboontan向來以甜美精緻容貌與火辣魔鬼身材見稱，早就成為泰國當地極具知名度人氣模特兒。翻看其社交平台過往帖文，低胸上衣及超短迷你裙絕對是她衣櫃中最常見必備單品，每次亮相總能充分展現出修長纖細雙腿以及誘人事業線。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚呢件衫設計「泰邪惡」</h2>\n<p>不少粉絲留意到衣服剪裁玄機，留言直指「呢件衫設計實在太邪惡」、「完全展現出最強視覺衝擊力」。更有網民表示被這輯充滿氛圍照片吸引，坦言「睇到女神去香港打卡我都想飛過去朝聖」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259117219717_2225760896afb1fdf9a03f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_5177357001594441046_y.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259117219717_2225760896afb1fdf9a03f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>泰國女神穿上一件緊身白色小背心，完美勾勒出火辣身材曲線。（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259272533142_1835429476afb1fe1267f8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_5177357001594441048_y.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259272533142_1835429476afb1fe1267f8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>隨著她擺出不同甫士，輕易展露出傲人南半球線條，營造出極大視覺衝擊力。（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259360526803_4594126356afb1fe1eb4f6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip.App_893399812_18679325587041248_5035789143804393232_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259360526803_4594126356afb1fe1eb4f6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>向來以甜美精緻容貌與火辣魔鬼身材見稱，早就成為泰國當地極具知名度人氣模特兒。（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259690012586_7983291586afb1fe59949d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip.App_863510567_18674164963041248_2782567477012800632_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259690012586_7983291586afb1fe59949d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>笑容甜美！（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259945187315_2406762636afb1fe7e5060.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip.App_499981292_18535373824041248_728514512673333279_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484259945187315_2406762636afb1fe7e5060.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>每次亮相總能充分展現出修長纖細雙腿以及誘人事業線。（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948426036612265_16461817776afb1fec1f773.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip.App_900634299_18680000539041248_5230849043687875108_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948426036612265_16461817776afb1fec1f773.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@vv____viewvy）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%80%a7%e6%84%9f%e7%a9%bf%e6%90%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">性感穿搭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b3%b0%e5%9c%8b%e7%b6%b2%e7%b4%85/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">泰國網紅</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%a6%99%e6%b8%af%e6%89%93%e5%8d%a1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港打卡</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544245\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 16 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T17:46:14.002110+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1128,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T15:23:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T17:39:40.544718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T17:39:40.544718+00:00","content_hash":"22a8d455740fb55f1fdee4c435553406e90df25c2b5ca6f94186fc9704652a54","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}